{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/4f887131840193b0ca19c86d16cc64db.avif?t=1770417230\" width=400 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a single-player adventure enriched with old-school RPG elements. The player takes control of a virtuous character who falls into a hell he does not belong to. Hell consists of various layers, each presenting challenging boss battles while offering a balanced combat system featuring both magic and physical attacks. In the terrifying atmosphere of hell, the player must fight to survive, collect valuable loot to grow stronger, and unravel the depths of a mysterious story that reveals the reason behind the character\u2019s descent into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/2d7bc5fb6081e2d799b046ceee25b216.avif?t=1770417230\" width=400 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/31f132864e5daa8abd020f9f6f39cf7c.poster.avif?t=1770417230\" width=810 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/31f132864e5daa8abd020f9f6f39cf7c.webm?t=1770417230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/d0610cd75daf5d8233e645a6ce340213.poster.avif?t=1770417230\" width=810 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/d0610cd75daf5d8233e645a6ce340213.webm?t=1770417230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light faded, leaving him in darkness once again, but this time it was not the suffocating stillness of the dungeon. His senses were overwhelmed. The air burned his lungs with every breath, carrying a stench of decay so intense it felt alive, crawling into his very being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams echoed endlessly, a symphony of agony that pierced his ears and reverberated in his chest. Shadows moved like specters, their forms writhing and shifting, each one a fragment of torment personified. He tried to avert his gaze, but the horrors refused to be ignored. Chains clanged in the distance, and the wet, guttural sounds of flesh being torn filled the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was no escape, no reprieve. The walls here were not just watching; they were alive, pulsating, as though feeding off the suffering within. The very air felt oppressive, crushing his thoughts, forcing him to acknowledge where he was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he was always someone who had hope. Maybe, it was the only thing he had...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416140?t=1770417230","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3416140?t=1770417230","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/069de46ee4b96fa9dcbc5c2eb4df792d250f7af3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770417230","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/069de46ee4b96fa9dcbc5c2eb4df792d250f7af3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770417230","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Narrated Game Menus","id":71},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Hell and Back contains blood and gore, hell torment, frequent violence."},"demos":[{"appid":3796580,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/4f887131840193b0ca19c86d16cc64db.avif?t=1770417230\" width=400 height=84 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game offers a single-player adventure enriched with old-school RPG elements. The player takes control of a virtuous character who falls into a hell he does not belong to. Hell consists of various layers, each presenting challenging boss battles while offering a balanced combat system featuring both magic and physical attacks. In the terrifying atmosphere of hell, the player must fight to survive, collect valuable loot to grow stronger, and unravel the depths of a mysterious story that reveals the reason behind the character\u2019s descent into hell.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/2d7bc5fb6081e2d799b046ceee25b216.avif?t=1770417230\" width=400 height=69 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/31f132864e5daa8abd020f9f6f39cf7c.poster.avif?t=1770417230\" width=810 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/31f132864e5daa8abd020f9f6f39cf7c.webm?t=1770417230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/d0610cd75daf5d8233e645a6ce340213.poster.avif?t=1770417230\" width=810 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3416140/extras/d0610cd75daf5d8233e645a6ce340213.webm?t=1770417230\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In Hell</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The light faded, leaving him in darkness once again, but this time it was not the suffocating stillness of the dungeon. His senses were overwhelmed. The air burned his lungs with every breath, carrying a stench of decay so intense it felt alive, crawling into his very being.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Screams echoed endlessly, a symphony of agony that pierced his ears and reverberated in his chest. Shadows moved like specters, their forms writhing and shifting, each one a fragment of torment personified. He tried to avert his gaze, but the horrors refused to be ignored. Chains clanged in the distance, and the wet, guttural sounds of flesh being torn filled the void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There was no escape, no reprieve. The walls here were not just watching; they were alive, pulsating, as though feeding off the suffering within. The very air felt oppressive, crushing his thoughts, forcing him to acknowledge where he was.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But he was always someone who had hope. Maybe, it was the only thing he had...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Labirent Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indi